<title>JAPAN: Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikuni and Co Ltd said on Friday it had assigned the following preliminary ratings to planned bond issues:</p>
<p>-BB-</p>
<p>Hokushin Co Ltd, five billion yen unsecured due 2001</p>
<p>The Toyo Trust &amp; Banking Co Ltd, 50 billion Euroyen unsecured convertible due 2002, private placement  </p>
<p>-B-</p>
<p>Doshisha Co Ltd., 0.49 billion yen unsecured with warrants due 2001</p>
<p>Sapporo Breweries Ltd., 10 billion yen unsecured due 2000</p>
<p>Zexel Corp., 15 billion yen unsecured due 2004</p>
<p>-CCC-</p>
<p>Mitsui Toatsu Chemicals Inc.,</p>
<p>10 billion yen unsecured due 2002</p>
<p>10 billion yen unsecured due 2004  </p>
<p>Nissho Iwai Corp., five billion yen unsecured due 2002</p>
</text>
